#
# RegTest for ZORK I: The Great Underground Empire
#
# An incomplete test suite for Zork I. It sends commands through Voxam,
# a pure-Python Z-machine interpreter, and checks the resulting output.
# <https://github.com/jeffnyman/voxam/>
# The 'sanity' test should pass in both r88 and r200. All other tests
# are designed to fail in r88 and pass in r200.
#
# Usage:
# $ python3 regtest.py -g path/to/zork.z3 path/to/this/file.regtest
#
** interpreter: voxam --plain --seed 92

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Some helper macros, adapted from this walkthrough:
# https://github.com/jeffnyman/voxam/blob/main/acceptance/zork1-r88-s840726.accept
#
# The most significant change is that you hold onto the matchbook long
# enough to drop it in the living room, where it can be easily accessed
# to test burning things.

* _go_to_nest
> n. n. u

* _go_to_kitchen
>{include} _go_to_nest
> get egg
> d. s. e
> open window
> w

* _go_to_cellar
>{include} _go_to_kitchen
> get all
> w
> open sack
> get lunch and garlic
> drop all
> get sword and lamp
> move rug
> open trapdoor
> open case
> e. u
> turn on lamp
> get all
> d

